          "topic": "Aethelian Starter Variants",
          "clarification": "The Aethelian variants of starter Pokémon from other regions (e.g., Bulbasaur, Chimchar, Popplio lines) are not offered as official starter choices by Professor Aspen. They are rare creatures that exist in the wild and must be discovered through exploration, making the native Aethel starters (Fawnora, Emberling, Kragshell) unique to the player's initial journey."
        },
        {
          "topic": "Aethelian Salmon Lines",
          "clarification": "The Aethelian Lumineon line represents a living, mystical salmon (Water/Psychic or Water/Fairy). The separate 'Salminy' and 'Solmancer' line represents the ghostly echo (Water/Ghost) of these creatures after they have completed their life's journey."
        }
      ],
